Tyrant
======

studio/static/hero.jpg is the main-menu background of Prehistoric Kingdom. It belongs to the
game's developer and publisher and is used only as the start-screen art of this modding tool,
with credit. Apart from the screenshots below, it is the only game content in this repository; Tyrant never ships game files.
tools/hero/extract_hero.py shows how it was exported from the game.

studio/static/backgrounds/bg-*.jpg are in-game screenshots of Prehistoric Kingdom taken by ViraLCyclopes, shown in
turn with the main-menu art on the start screen. The game's art in them belongs to its developer and publisher.

core/Tyrant.Core/Resources/classdata.tpk is Unity's class type database from AssetRipper/Tpk
(https://github.com/AssetRipper/Tpk, MIT License, Copyright (c) 2022 ds5678). Tyrant uses it to read the game's
built-in asset files, which carry no type information of their own.
